sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant L as Leader
    participant W as Workers (N shards)<br/>(versioned store + LRU cache)

    C->>L: run(entities, lookups)
    L->>W: create shard group
    L->>L: generate fake features and lookup requests

    Note over L,W: Phase 1: ingest
    loop each batch of features
        L->>W: ingest_features(chunk)
        W->>W: store latest 3 versions,<br/>warm cache
        W-->>L: ingested count
    end

    Note over L,W: Phase 2: online serving
    loop each batch of lookups
        L->>W: batch_lookup(requests)
        W->>W: cache hit, else read store
        W-->>L: features + hit/miss counts
    end

    L->>W: get_stats
    W-->>L: stored features, cache stats
    L-->>C: lookups/sec, cache hit rate, timing
